WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.560
Connect your phone, and your team's phones, to this panel to see chats, alerts and approvals on the go. The phone app installs from the phone's browser onto the home screen.

2
00:00:12.106 --> 00:00:21.740
First set up a fixed public address; with the temporary one, the phone cannot connect. Then click Connect a phone to show the QR code.

3
00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:29.990
Scan the code with the phone's camera; it works once, for ten minutes. Then install the app on the home screen.

4
00:00:30.538 --> 00:00:38.160
In the phone app, turn on alerts. Connected phones appear here; disconnect a lost phone right away.

5
00:00:38.709 --> 00:00:44.660
Never send the connection code to anyone: whoever scans it gets access to your chats.
